@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### Send a gift voucher with a message
POST {{base}}/payments/gift-vouchers/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "student": {{student}}, "amount": "2500", "message": "Well done on your exams!", "channel": "momo", "payer_phone": "0772000111", "idempotency_key": "gift-0001" }

### Gift vouchers sent / received
GET {{base}}/payments/gift-vouchers/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a top-up link for relatives; share "share_url" as-is (WhatsApp, SMS…)
POST {{base}}/payments/topup-links/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "student": {{student}} }

### My links
GET {{base}}/payments/topup-links/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke a link
POST {{base}}/payments/topup-links/1/revoke/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
